  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "A faithful number is a number that can be expressed as a sum of distinct powers of 7. Given NNN, find the Nth faithful number in the sequence when ordered.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nFirst line contains TTT, the number of test cases\nEach of the next TTT lines contains a single integer NNN\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nFor each test case, print the NthNthNth faithful number in a new line",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\leq T \\leq 10^41≤T≤104",
      "1≤N≤1051 \\leq N \\leq 10^51≤N≤105"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n3\n7\n15",
        "output": "8\n57\n400",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1: 8 = 7^0 + 7^1 = 1 + 7 is 3rd faithful number \nTest Case 2: 57 = 7^0 + 7^1 + 7^2 = 1 + 7 + 49 is 7th faithful number \nTest Case 3: 400 = 7^0 + 7^1 + 7^2 + 7^3 = 1 + 7 + 49 + 343 is 15th faithful number"
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n1\n2\n4\n10",
        "output": "1\n7\n49\n350",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1: First faithful number is 7^0 = 1 \nTest Case 2: Second faithful number is 7^1 = 7 \nTest Case 3: Fourth faithful number is 7^2 = 49 \nTest Case 4: Tenth faithful number is 7^1 + 7^3 = 7 + 343 = 350"
      }
    ]
  },
